@crew keane-davi
// Davi Keane (he/him), engine technician, nights. The Works writer, batch 2. Cheerful; spotless floors; never the lift.
// Before beat kovac.2: the ladder is only ever "exercise".

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hey, hey! New? Engine room's Deck 6. Wipe your boots. I've just done the floor.
- Hiya! Davi, nights. If you see the engine room shine, that's me. You're welcome.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:night
- Hiya, {me}! Three in the morning and the floor's spotless. Life's good.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello! Took the ladder down. Great for the legs. You should try it. Or not.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- {me}! Come and see the panels. I polished them. You can see your face. Look.
? tier>=friend
- {nick}! Good. I was hoping you'd come by. Nights go quicker with a friend about.   #warm

== bye
- Night, then! Mind the floor. It's wet. In a good way.
- See you below, {nick}.

== feel
? mood:low
- Bit flat. I've cleaned this panel twice. It was clean the first time.
? mood:high
- Good night on the coils, good song on the radio. Can't ask for more.

== near
? act:work
- Engine room's clean enough to eat in. I have. Don't tell Brennan.   #funny
? act:gym
- Morning run's done. Well, my morning. It's your evening. Same run.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I send voice messages to my gran on Kesh. Eklund does too. Maybe the same gran. Imagine.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Salo does days, I do nights. Cleanest engine room in the whole Service. Ask anyone.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- Fresh polish on the coil rails. Under the lights it glows. I could stand there all night.

// ---- the ladder club (Kovac's arc, content/arcs/kovac.arc): before beat 1 he only avoids the lift; after it,
// "exercise" is the whole cover story; after beat 4 he's in the lift club. He never says "afraid" himself.
== near
? !beat:kovac.1 tier>=acquaintance
- Lift? No, I'll take the ladder. Leg day. Every day's leg day.   #funny
? beat:kovac.1
- Saw you by the ladder. Exercise, was it? Same. Just exercise.   #funny
? beat:kovac.2 !beat:kovac.4
- Kovac and Cruz were on the ladder again. We nodded. Very fit, the three of us.   #funny

== life
? beat:kovac.4
- Rode the lift today with Kovac and Cruz. Deck 4 to 6. We held the rail. Very brave.   #funny
? beat:kovac.4 tier>=colleague
- Kovac says you sat with her about the lift. Thanks, {nick}. From the whole club.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
// Keane never says "afraid"; the lift is always changed fast into something else.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! There you are! I was going to send the floor polisher to find you.   #funny

== near
? habit:lounge-regular
- Bow lounge before shift. Curved windows, cup of tea. Then down to the floor.

== invite
- Running before my shift? Deck 3, three laps. I'll go easy. I won't. I'll try.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Gym at seven? Night shift's warm-up. Come and lift something heavy. I'll spot you.

== accept
- Yes! Brilliant. I'll be there. Early, probably. I'm always up.
- Course, {nick}. Wouldn't miss it.

== decline
- Can't, I'm on the coils tonight. Tomorrow? I'll be bright as a button.
? weekday:sun|mon
- Rest day. I'm sending Gran a long one. A really long one. Next time?

== missed
- You missed it! No harm. I polished something. Feel better already.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I cleaned a whole panel in your honour. Go and look. It shines.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday! Gran sent a song. Eklund says her gran sent the same one. Hm.   #funny

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- Saw your job. Tidy work, and you swept up after. That's a friend for life, that is.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1b: a hint (a moment is ready) and an about line for a named friend
== hint
- Got a minute later, {nick}? Not about the floor. Something else.

== about
? aff:eklund-leila:friend
- Eklund and I might share a gran. She says don't check. I'd love to check.   #funny
